# Event Logging

RULE: Use `setup_events()` and `log_event()` from unified-events-interface. 11 required for batch / 12 for live (STARTED through FAILED, plus live-only CONNECTION_ESTABLISHED). `tests/unit/test_event_logging.py` MUST exist and never be skipped.
WHY: UTD v2 parses events for real-time progress, debugging, and cost optimization.
CODEX: 03-observability/lifecycle-events.md

DO:
  from unified_events_interface import setup_events, log_event
  setup_events(service_name="my-service", mode="batch")
  log_event("STARTED"); log_event("VALIDATION_STARTED"); ... log_event("STOPPED")

NEVER:
  from unified_cloud_services.observability import log_event
  setup_cloud_logging
  Exit without logging STOPPED or FAILED
